{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAHUR: Escape Together</strong> \u2013 A cooperative survival horror game for 1-4 players. Band together to survive a night of terror and stop the deranged Sahur. Explore dangerous streets, scavenge for resources, and stay clear of his minions\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key genres:</strong> Horror, memes, action, coop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What makes it special?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI that adapts to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising difficulty as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated elements for unique gameplay every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both cooperative and solo modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meme-worthy characters like <i>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</i>, <i>Tralalero Tralala</i>, and <i>Balerino Capucino</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: This game is a work of fiction. Any resemblance to real events or persons is purely coincidental. It does not promote or endorse any ideology, nor is it intended to offend or harm anyone.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hide-and-seek","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736520/b299b9d43e70b6008c5eed7df5e85dab79188f92.jpg"},{"name":"Guzini","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736520/d7b74d90f91162677bae87b0e7eb2c602f6a9b8d.jpg"},{"name":"Nooo la polizia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736520/3529a96aef13915012f72853bd6b1e5ef1547df5.jpg"},{"name":"Only Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3736520/e36e9099e25093c6732b61cb1c098c2ac0c67d60.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamst